agm-0964: AGM H6 keys and PMIC watchdog feeding (bsd/dev/agm_keys.c): Volume
Down on AP GPIO 124, Power and Volume Up on SC2730 EIC 1/4 over the ADI bus, polled
every 20 ms into sweet_hid_key(); the SC2730 watchdog is reloaded for 10 minutes
every minute.

